  <data name="Card_Help_None" xml:space="preserve"><value>No Arc B580 or B570 was found on the PCI bus. Check that the card is seated, has its power cables, and that the BIOS has Above 4G decoding and Resizable BAR on.</value></data>
  <data name="Card_Help_Untested" xml:space="preserve"><value>Supported, untested: nobody has run the driver on a B570 yet. Please try it and send a report, whether it works or not.</value></data>
