  <data name="Efi_Stage2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Settings (stage 2)</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Caption" xml:space="preserve"><value>SIP, the AMFI boot-arg and the GPU quirks, as stage 2 sets them.</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>SIP (csr-active-config), the boot-args amfi_get_out_of_my_way=0x1 and intelxe_surfvram=2, ResizeAppleGpuBars, DisableIoMapper and ReconnectGraphicsOnConnect, as stage 2 of the install guide sets them. Separate from the driver's files (stage 4); your other settings stay as they are.</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Item1" xml:space="preserve"><value>csr-active-config at least 03080000 (a wider value stays)</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Item2" xml:space="preserve"><value>amfi_get_out_of_my_way=0x1 and intelxe_surfvram=2 added to the boot-args (yours stay)</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Item3" xml:space="preserve"><value>csr-active-config and boot-args in NVRAM &gt; Delete</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_Item4" xml:space="preserve"><value>ResizeAppleGpuBars = 10, DisableIoMapper = true, ReconnectGraphicsOnConnect = false</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage2_When" xml:space="preserve"><value>Any time after macOS is installed; then restart into macOS.</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4" xml:space="preserve"><value>IntelXe.kext and SSDT-ARCOFF (stage 4)</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Caption" xml:space="preserve"><value>After sudo ./install.sh --apply on macOS, before the restart.</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>The last piece loads before macOS: IntelXe.kext and SSDT-ARCOFF go into the EFI and its config, and on a 12th-14th gen Intel CPU with efficiency cores HybridPM.kext too. The EFI page shows the plan and applies it.</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Item1" xml:space="preserve"><value>IntelXe.kext copied when missing or different, its Kernel &gt; Add entry added or turned on; an earlier B580.kext entry turned off</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Item2" xml:space="preserve"><value>SSDT-ARCOFF.aml for the card's ACPI path (the shipped table is adapted to another path)</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Item3" xml:space="preserve"><value>1 added to Misc &gt; Security &gt; ExposeSensitiveData, so that macOS tools find the EFI OpenCore booted from</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Stage4_Item4" xml:space="preserve"><value>On a 12th-14th gen Intel CPU with efficiency cores: HybridPM.kext, right below Lilu.kext</value></data>
  <data name="Efi_Acpi" xml:space="preserve"><value>The card's ACPI path</value></data>
