  <data name="Report_Section" xml:space="preserve"><value>Diagnostics report</value></data>
  <data name="Report_Caption" xml:space="preserve"><value>Changes and uploads nothing; private details are removed. About a minute.</value></data>
  <data name="Report_Detail" xml:space="preserve"><value>Collects the hardware, the firmware settings Windows can see (Resizable BAR, Above 4G decoding, Secure Boot), the GPU drivers, the monitors and a dxdiag report. It changes nothing and uploads nothing. Serial numbers, UUIDs, MAC addresses, user and computer names and Wi-Fi names are removed, and no file is written if anything shaped like a Windows product key is left. The zip goes on your Desktop.</value></data>
